'''Chance of Tornado''' (爆風ときどき竜巻, ''Bakufū Tokidoki Tatsumaki'', '''Violent Wind with Occasional Tornadoes''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

